WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.070
Thirteen forty-eight.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:06.190
A terrible plague reaches
England: the Black Death.

3
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.610
Within two years, it kills
between a third and a half of the

4
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.670
people.

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.870
Nobody understands germs.

6
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.290
Many blame God's anger, or bad air.

7
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.730
Here is the puzzle.

8
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.510
For many peasants who survived,
life began to get better.

9
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.870
How can a disaster leave
the survivors better off?

10
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.130
In this mission, you'll follow
a chain of consequences,

11
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.080
link by link.

12
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.630
You'll meet a rebel
leader called Wat Tyler,

13
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.150
and a fourteen-year-old king.

14
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.530
Your mission: explain why some
survivors of the Black Death

15
00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.140
were better off.
